    "original_requirement": "构建一个智能窗帘与照明联动系统，使用光敏电阻 A0、室内温度传感器 LM35（A1）、舵机控制引脚 D9、室内灯 LED D10、按钮 D2、D3 和 TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）。自动模式下光照过强时关闭窗帘、光照过弱时开启窗帘并点亮室内灯；若温度过高则优先关闭窗帘以降低室温。按钮用于切换自动/手动和调整窗帘角度，TM1637 显示当前窗帘开度百分比或光照值。",
    "effective_requirement": "构建一个智能窗帘与照明联动系统，使用光敏电阻 A0、室内温度传感器 LM35（A1）、舵机控制引脚 D9、室内灯 LED D10、按钮 D2、D3 和 TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）。自动模式下光照过强时关闭窗帘、光照过弱时开启窗帘并点亮室内灯；若温度过高则优先关闭窗帘以降低室温。按钮用于切换自动/手动和调整窗帘角度，TM1637 显示当前窗帘开度百分比或光照值。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A1\"}, {\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A0\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D2\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D3\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D10\"}, {\"device_role\": \"servo_angle\", \"pin\": \"D9\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D5\"}], \"serial\": null}",
